==Strategy==
A simple stage, use the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to easily beat it. Utilize [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Brave Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] to deal a lot of damage to [[St. Pigge the 2nd]].

